{"id": "lowres-tatoeba-he-0000", "text": "שביתה שיבשה את הדואר.", "lang": "he", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono, he)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "lowres-tatoeba-he-0001", "text": "אני שונא את הכל!", "lang": "he", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono, he)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "lowres-tatoeba-he-0002", "text": "הפשיסט הטוב היחיד הוא פשיסט מת.", "lang": "he", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono, he)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "lowres-tatoeba-he-0003", "text": "כל החתולים יפים.", "lang": "he", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono, he)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "lowres-tatoeba-he-0004", "text": "וַיֹּאמֶר אֱלֹהִים יְהִי אוֹר וַיְהִי-אוֹר.", "lang": "he", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono, he)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "lowres-tatoeba-he-0005", "text": "וְנֹחַ מָצָא חֵן בְּעֵינֵי יְהֹוָה:", "lang": "he", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono, he)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "lowres-tatoeba-he-0006", "text": "האנטישמיות היא הסוציאליזם של הטפשים.", "lang": "he", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono, he)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "lowres-tatoeba-he-0007", "text": "אין אלוה מלבד אלוהים.", "lang": "he", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono, he)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "lowres-tatoeba-he-0008", "text": "אין אל חוץ מאלוהים.", "lang": "he", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono, he)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "lowres-tatoeba-he-0009", "text": "יש בנות עם פין, בנים עם פות וטרנספובים בלי שיניים.", "lang": "he", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono, he)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "lowres-tatoeba-he-0010", "text": "למילי יש חתול.", "lang": "he", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono, he)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "lowres-tatoeba-he-0011", "text": "פשיסט טוב זה פשיסט מת.", "lang": "he", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono, he)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "lowres-tatoeba-he-0012", "text": "אנחנו רוצים לקנות בית חדש.", "lang": "he", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono, he)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "lowres-tatoeba-he-0013", "text": "אני רואה את האריה הלבן.", "lang": "he", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono, he)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "lowres-tatoeba-he-0014", "text": "המלחמה בתימן חייבת להסתיים.", "lang": "he", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono, he)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "lowres-tatoeba-he-0015", "text": "תום לא טראמפ.", "lang": "he", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono, he)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "lowres-tatoeba-he-0016", "text": "היה לנו חתול.", "lang": "he", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono, he)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "lowres-tatoeba-he-0017", "text": "יש לנו חתול.", "lang": "he", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono, he)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "lowres-tatoeba-he-0018", "text": "אני חתולה.", "lang": "he", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono, he)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
